💻 eBay HTML Listing Description Code (Full BLKHDZ Branded Template)

Copy and paste the HTML snippet below directly into the HTML view editor of your eBay listing form:




    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Pop Race 1/64 Mazda RX-7 FD3S RE Amemiya Enigma Exclusive #021 - BLKHDZ LLC</title>
    <style>
        /* STREAMING_CHUNK:Configuring base setup and layout colors... */
        /* Base Setup */
        body {
            background-color: #0c0c0c; /* Smooth page backdrop */
            margin: 0;
            padding: 20px;
        }

        /* MASTER STRUCTURE */
        .container {
            max-width: 1050px; 
            margin: auto;
            box-sizing: border-box;
        }

        /* TWO-COLUMN LAYOUT ENGINE */
        .main-layout {
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: row;
            gap: 20px;
            align-items: flex-start;
        }

        /* LIVE CATEGORY SIDEBAR PANEL */
        .sidebar {
            width: 240px;
            background-color: #111111;
            padding: 25px 15px;
            border: 3px solid #00d2ff; /* Enigma Electric Blue Theme Accent */
            border-radius: 4px;
            box-sizing: border-box;
            flex-shrink: 0;
            font-family: 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;
            box-shadow: 0 0 15px rgba(0, 210, 255, 0.3);
            line-height: 1.5;
        }

        .sidebar-title {
            color: #ffffff;
            font-weight: 900;
            font-size: 14px;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: 1px;
            margin-bottom: 15px;
            border-bottom: 2px solid #00d2ff;
            padding-bottom: 8px;
            font-style: italic;
            text-align: center;
        }

        .category-list {
            list-style: none;
            padding: 0;
            margin: 0;
        }

        .category-list li {
            background: rgba(0, 210, 255, 0.05);
            margin-bottom: 10px;
            border-left: 4px solid #00d2ff;
            border-radius: 2px;
            transition: transform 0.2s;
        }

        .category-list li:hover {
            transform: translateX(5px);
            background: rgba(0, 210, 255, 0.15);
        }

        .category-list a {
            display: block;
            padding: 10px 12px;
            color: #ffffff;
            text-decoration: none;
            font-weight: 700;
            font-size: 12px;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: 1px;
        }

        /* STREAMING_CHUNK:Styling main card structure and header text... */
        /* MAIN CARD STRUCTURAL DISPLAY */
        .original-card {
            background-color: #111111;
            background-image: linear-gradient(45deg, #0a0a0a 25%, transparent 25%, transparent 75%, #0a0a0a 75%, #0a0a0a), 
                              linear-gradient(45deg, #0a0a0a 25%, #000000 25%, #000000 75%, #0a0a0a 75%, #0a0a0a);
            background-size: 10px 10px;
            background-position: 0 0, 5px 5px;
            color: #cccccc;
            font-family: 'Arial', sans-serif;
            border: 4px solid #00d2ff;
            border-radius: 4px;
            box-shadow: 0 0 25px rgba(0, 210, 255, 0.4);
            overflow: hidden;
            flex-grow: 1;
            box-sizing: border-box;
            line-height: 1.6;
        }

        .header {
            background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);
            text-align: center;
            padding: 45px 15px;
            border-bottom: 4px solid #00d2ff;
        }

        .header h1 {
            margin: 0;
            font-family: 'Arial Black', 'Impact', sans-serif;
            font-style: italic;
            font-weight: 900;
            font-size: clamp(24px, 8vw, 42px);
            line-height: 0.9;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            color: #fff;
            text-shadow: 0 0 10px #00d2ff, 0 0 20px #0055ff;
        }

        .sub-header {
            margin-top: 15px;
            display: inline-block;
            font-family: 'Arial Black', sans-serif;
            font-weight: bold;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            color: #00d2ff; /* Bright electric blue contrast */
            font-size: 18px;
            transform: scaleX(1.4);
            letter-spacing: 5px;
            white-space: nowrap;
        }

        .content {
            padding: 25px;
        }

        .brief-box {
            background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.85);
            border: 1px solid #00d2ff;
            color: #fff;
            padding: 20px;
            text-align: center;
            margin-bottom: 30px;
            box-shadow: inset 0 0 20px rgba(0, 210, 255, 0.2);
        }

        .section-title {
            color: #fff;
            font-family: 'Arial Black', sans-serif;
            font-size: 20px;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            margin-top: 35px;
            margin-bottom: 15px;
            border-left: 10px solid #00d2ff;
            padding-left: 15px;
            font-style: italic;
            background: linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(0, 210, 255, 0.3) 0%, rgba(0,0,0,0) 100%);
            padding-top: 5px;
            padding-bottom: 5px;
        }

        /* STREAMING_CHUNK:Formatting manifest data table and call-to-action... */
        .manifest-container {
            text-align: center;
            margin: 30px 0;
        }

        .manifest-box {
            display: inline-block;
            background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.95);
            border: 2px solid #00d2ff;
            box-shadow: 0 0 15px #00d2ff;
            padding: 20px;
            text-align: center;
            min-width: 280px;
        }

        .manifest-title {
            color: #fff;
            margin: 0 0 15px 0;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            font-family: 'Arial Black', sans-serif;
            font-size: 18px;
            letter-spacing: 4px;
            border-bottom: 2px solid #00d2ff;
            padding-bottom: 8px;
        }

        .manifest-list {
            font-size: 11pt;
            color: #bbbbbb;
            line-height: 1.8;
            text-transform: uppercase;
        }

        .manifest-list b { color: #fff; }

        .cta-container {
            text-align: center;
            padding: 50px 15px;
            background: rgba(0,0,0,0.8);
            border-top: 4px solid #00d2ff;
        }

        .cta-btn-wrap {
            display: inline-block;
            transform: skew(-12deg);
            border: 2px solid #ffffff;
            box-shadow: 8px 8px 0px #00d2ff;
        }

        .cta-link {
            display: block;
            background: linear-gradient(90deg, #00d2ff, #0055ff);
            color: #ffffff !important;
            padding: 22px 45px;
            text-decoration: none;
            font-family: 'Impact', sans-serif;
            font-size: 28px;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: 4px;
            font-style: italic;
            text-shadow: 2px 2px 4px #000;
        }

        .footer-brand {
            font-size: 12px;
            letter-spacing: 6px;
            color: #fff;
            font-weight: bold;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            opacity: 0.7;
            margin-top: 25px;
        }

        /* RESPONSIVE MOBILE FIXES */
        @media (max-width: 768px) {
            .main-layout {
                flex-direction: column;
                align-items: center;
            }
            .sidebar {
                width: 100%;
            }
            .category-list {
                display: grid;
                grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
                gap: 8px;
            }
            .category-list li {
                margin-bottom: 0;
            }
            .original-card {
                width: 100%;
            }
            body {
                padding: 10px;
            }
            .sub-header {
                font-size: 14px;
                transform: scaleX(1);
                letter-spacing: 3px;
                white-space: normal;
                display: block;
            }
            .cta-link { font-size: 22px; padding: 15px 25px; }
        }
    </style>



<div class="container">
    <div class="main-layout">

        <!-- Live Category Sidebar Panel -->
        <div class="sidebar">
            <div class="sidebar-title">THE BLKHDZ VAULT</div>
            <ul class="category-list">
                <li><a href="https://www.ebay.com/str/blkhdz" target="_blank">⚡ VIEW ALL INVENTORY</a></li>
                <li><a href="https://www.ebay.com/str/blkhdz/1-64/_i.html?store_cat=24199049015" target="_blank">🏎️ 1/64 DIECAST</a></li>
                <li><a href="https://www.ebay.com/str/blkhdz/1-43/_i.html?store_cat=24199048015" target="_blank">🏁 1/43 DIECAST</a></li>
                <li><a href="https://www.ebay.com/str/blkhdz/LEGO-Speed-Champions-Cars/_i.html?store_cat=23978724015" target="_blank">🏎️ SPEED CHAMPIONS</a></li>
                <li><a href="https://www.ebay.com/str/blkhdz/Star-Wars/_i.html?store_cat=24068130015" target="_blank">🚀 STAR WARS DEPT</a></li>
                <li><a href="https://www.ebay.com/str/blkhdz/LEGO-Architecture/_i.html?store_cat=23989364015" target="_blank">🏛️ LEGO ARCHITECT</a></li>
            </ul>
        </div>

        <!-- Main Card Structural Display -->
        <div class="original-card">
            <div class="header">
                <h1>JDM ELITE<br>MAZDA RX-7 FD3S ASSET</h1>
                <div class="sub-header">RE AMEMIYA ENIGMA EXCLUSIVE #021</div>
            </div>

            <div class="content">
                <!-- Mandated High-Impact Segoe UI Typography Stack Asset Briefing -->
                <div style="background-color: #000000; padding: 25px; border-left: 10px solid #00d2ff; margin-bottom: 30px; box-shadow: 3px 3px 0px #000;">
                    <p style="font-family: 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 13pt; line-height: 1.5; text-align: left; color: #ffffff; margin: 0; font-weight: 600;">
                        <span style="background-color: #00d2ff; color: #000000; padding: 3px 10px; font-weight: 900; margin-right: 8px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 1px; font-style: italic; font-size: 11pt; display: inline-block; vertical-align: middle;">ASSET ACQUIRED:</span> Pop Race 1/64 Mazda RX-7 (FD3S) RE Amemiya Enigma Exclusive #021. This elite rotary scale specimen showcases striking custom <span style="text-decoration: underline; font-weight: 800; color: #00d2ff;">Blue &amp; White Enigma Livery</span> graphics. Features precision tool engineering with a functional opening bonnet to reveal the detailed 13B rotary engine assembly underneath. Verified factory sealed tracking stock.
                    </p>
                </div>

                <div class="brief-box">
                    <strong>MISSION BRIEFING:</strong><br>
                    High-priority JDM performance target deployment. This premium asset features the legendary RE Amemiya widebody RX-7 FD3S platform engineered with real rubber tires and custom tuner wheels. Embodying golden-era Japanese rotary tuning heritage, this unit is <strong>IN HAND</strong> at our Tampa facility and secured for immediate collection integration.
                </div>

                <div class="manifest-container">
                    <div class="manifest-box">
                        <div class="manifest-title">MANIFEST DATA</div>
                        <div class="manifest-list">
                            <b>CHASSIS:</b> MAZDA RX-7 (FD3S) RE AMEMIYA<br>
                            <b>SKU CODE:</b> PRE021 / ENIGMA #021<br>
                            <b>FINISH:</b> BLUE &amp; WHITE ENIGMA TUNER LIVERY<br>
                            <b>FEATURES:</b> OPENING HOOD / 13B ROTARY ENGINE<br>
                            <b>SCALE:</b> 1:64 DIECAST METAL
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class="section-title">LOGISTICS BRIEF</div>
                <p>This premium tracking payload is protected inside its original manufacturer unopened blister packaging. Secure handling is fully enforced at our Tampa hub: items are packed safely with protective wrap and dispatched exclusively in heavy-duty cardboard containers. No bubble mailers are permitted. Zero-defect transit integrity is our baseline standard.</p>

                <div style="text-align: center; margin-top: 30px;">
                    <p style="font-size: 10pt; color: #555; font-style: italic; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 5px; font-weight: bold; font-family: 'Helvetica', sans-serif;">
                        BLKHDZ // TAMPA FL
                    </p>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="cta-container">
                <div class="cta-btn-wrap">
                    <a href="https://www.ebay.com/str/blkhdz" class="cta-link">ACQUIRE TARGET</a>
                </div>
                <div class="footer-brand">VETERAN OWNED</div>
            </div>
        </div>

    </div>
</div>
